{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019174548385-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019210140\"/><p>今日(19日)下午3時39分，大埔社山村一名村屋男住戶報案，指其愛貓懷疑被鄰居的飼養的8隻狗咬死。警員到場了解，並且尋獲一具貓咪屍體，身上留下懷疑咬痕。經初步調解後，涉事鄰居表示願意賠償。警員經調查後，相信案件無可疑，將會轉交漁護署作進一步跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:20:03.812372+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:45:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:22.201318+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:17:47.515542+00:00","content_hash":"acc51f913957394b02a7a14c678bc3fad31c781b244e2e7c27da93f12bab2ebb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}